      en: ["The hydroelectric plant has a massive total capacity of 1,008 Megawatts (MW).", "Home to a 145 MW floating solar power plant, the largest in Southeast Asia.", "The Citarum River is the primary water source for this and two other major dams.", "The powerhouse is located 200 meters underground for structural stability.", "The dam's reservoir covers a surface area of over 6,000 hectares.", "The floating solar panels help reduce water evaporation from the reservoir.", "Plays a vital role in providing 'black start' capability to the national power grid.", "A major center for freshwater fishing and local tourism in West Java."]
